r reportable segment. We also updated our internal organizational structure, which included the transfer of two teams from our VistaPrint reportable segment into our central functions. We have recast the prior periods presented for segment revenue and segment EBITDA for both changes to ensure comparability with the current fiscal year. These changes have no impact on our consolidated financial results. Refer to Note 11 in our accompanying consolidated financial statements for additional details. VistaPrint\nIn thousands Three Months Ended March 31, Nine Months Ended March 31,\n2026 2025 (1) 2026 vs. 2025 2026 2025 (1) 2026 vs. 2025\nReported Revenue $ 460,368 $ 430,726 7% $ 1,448,104 $ 1,358,044 7%\nSegment EBITDA 88,875 83,183 7% 285,821 261,515 9%\n% of revenue 19 % 19 % 20 % 19 %\n"}
